(7728893, 1272658, 70896, '<td valign="top">Such an interesting subject, but the fingers are a bit distracting. I also think a bit more contrast and sharpness would be make it pop more!</td>', 'Such an interesting subject, but the fingers are a bit distracting. I also think a bit more contrast and sharpness would be make it pop more!', '2022-08-29 17:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
